# Repo split (DONE 2026-06-12 — folders untracked): each lives in its own repo
# with its own GH Actions deploy. Local folders are standalone working copies.
# Never `git add -f` these back into the monorepo.
# fe/ — frontend grouping (mirrors be/); relocated under fe/ 2026-06-12.
# fe/pos-system → https://github.com/chepelcr/tsuru-pos-system
fe/pos-system/

# fe/landing → https://github.com/chepelcr/tsuru-landing
fe/landing/

# fe/storefront-sdk → https://github.com/chepelcr/tsuru-storefront-sdk
# Shared storefront data-layer package (published to GitHub Packages, consumed by the
# templates). Own repo; local folder is a standalone working copy.
fe/storefront-sdk/

# fe/dashboard → private chepelcr/tsuru-admin-dashboard (local-only; no deploy workflow)
fe/dashboard/

# be/ — each subfolder is its own standalone git repo
be/management-be/
be/store-be/
be/sales-be/
be/data-be/
be/support-be/
# be/cognito-templates → https://github.com/chepelcr/tsuru-cognito-templates
# Cognito CustomMessage trigger Lambda + SES email templates. Its own repo; cloned
# here (2026-09-19, TSR-308) so the trigger is editable from the workspace.
be/cognito-templates/

# Infrastructure — own git repo
Infrastructure/

